| 5 | Avg Single CT Size / 平均单密文大小 | `14190587267/42450 = 334289` | 326.45 KB |
| 6 | Avg Aggregated CT Size / 平均聚合密文大小 | `= single_ct_size (ideal xMK-CKKS assumption)` | 326.45 KB |
